    "copyright": "\n          PUBLIC DOMAIN\n        ",
    "verseCount": 8,
    "content": "<p class=\"d\">A Song of Ascents.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"1\" data-sid=\"PSA 121:1\" class=\"v\">1</span>I will lift up my eyes to the hills.</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 121:1\" class=\"q2\">Where does my help come from?</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"2\" data-sid=\"PSA 121:2\" class=\"v\">2</span>My help comes from Yahweh,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 121:2\" class=\"q2\">who made heaven and earth.</p><p class=\"b\"></p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"3\" data-sid=\"PSA 121:3\" class=\"v\">3</span>He will not allow your foot to be moved.</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 121:3\" class=\"q2\">He who keeps you will not slumber.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"4\" data-sid=\"PSA 121:4\" class=\"v\">4</span>Behold, he who keeps Israel</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 121:4\" class=\"q2\">will neither slumber nor sleep.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"5\" data-sid=\"PSA 121:5\" class=\"v\">5</span>Yahweh is your keeper.</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 121:5\" class=\"q2\">Yahweh is your shade on your right hand.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"6\" data-sid=\"PSA 121:6\" class=\"v\">6</span>The sun will not harm you by day,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 121:6\" class=\"q2\">nor the moon by night.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"7\" data-sid=\"PSA 121:7\" class=\"v\">7</span>Yahweh will keep you from all evil.</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 121:7\" class=\"q2\">He will keep your soul.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"8\" data-sid=\"PSA 121:8\" class=\"v\">8</span>Yahweh will keep your going out and your coming in,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 121:8\" class=\"q2\">from this time forward, and forever more.</p>",
